      "entries": [
        "The forge-spurned draws a massive breath to refill its emptied lungs, enabling it to use Forge Breath again."
      ],
      "requirements": "The forgespurned has used Forge Breath."
    },
    {
      "name": "Forge Breath",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 2,
        "symbol": "◆◆"
      },
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "evocation",
        "fire"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "The forge-spurned breathes a cloud of stinging soot, ash, and glowing embers. This can affect either a 30-foot cone or a 20-foot burst centered on the forge-spurned and persists for 1d4 rounds. Each creature that moves into or starts their turn in the area takes 6d6 fire damage, with a DC 21 basic Reflex save. A creature that fails its save is also blinded for 1 minute. Creatures within the cloud are concealed, though not from the forge-spurned. The forge-spurned can't use Forge Breath again until it has used Inflate Bellows."
      ],
      "area": {
        "shape": "cone",
        "size": 30,
        "unit": "ft"
      },
      "save": {
        "defense": "reflex",
        "dc": 21,
        "basic": true,
        "outcomes": {
          "criticalSuccess": "none",
          "success": "half",
          "failure": "full",
          "criticalFailure": "double"
        }
      },
      "damage": [
        {
          "formula": "6d6",
          "average": null,
          "type": "fire"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Soul Chain",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "fire",
        "necromancy"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "If a creature is slain by an attack from the soul chain and the forge-spurned is able to retain the creature's corpse, it can bind the creature's soul into the soul chain (as bind soul) with a day of work at a forge and a successful DC 20 Crafting check. An individual whose soul is bound in this way can't be resurrected unless the soul chain is destroyed (Hardness 5, HP 20, BT 10)."
      ]
    }
